  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Shallow Grave** (1 other source): Comes from the forthcoming album Days, which was unannounced on this tour and unreleased at upload time [1]\n- **Younger** (1 other source): The band came back onstage halfway through this song, as was standard on this tour [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Rocks in My Pockets**: rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Song for an Old Friend**: back after 55 archived shows (867 days) [4]\n- **The Mess Inside**: back after 25 archived shows (557 days) [4]\n- **Song for My Stepfather**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n- **Younger**: back after 68 archived shows (983 days) [4]\n- **Great Pirates**: rare: 13 archived performances [4]\n- **Sicilian Crest**: back after 28 archived shows (621 days) [4]\n- **Broken to Begin With**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Shallow Grave [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2026-04-17.h4n** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 103 min [1]\n- **tmg2026-04-17.h1n.flac24**: source not stated; 24 songs; 104 min [2]\n- **tmg2026-04-17.h1n.flac16**: source not stated; 24 songs; 104 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No I Can't tease,, Woke Up New, jazz No Children [1]\n- Taper sat in front row of booth seating, just behind the pit, in booth 8 [1]\n- First Australian visit in nine years; the band drew its largest Melbourne crowd so far [2]\n- The band walked on while a Birthday Party tune played over the PA [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2026-04-17.h4n**: source: Zoom H4n [1]\n- **tmg2026-04-17.h1n.flac24**: taped by Claire Laura Fredriksson; source: Zoom H1n internal mics, bass rolloff @ 80 Hz [2]\n- **tmg2026-04-17.h1n.flac16**: taped by Claire Laura Fredriksson; source: Zoom H1n internal mics, bass rolloff @ 80 Hz [3]",
